@startuml communication
!include _style.iuml
title Диаграмма коммуникации — успешная оплата (номер = порядок сообщения)

rectangle "Сервер магазина" as Shop
rectangle "API /v1" as API
rectangle "CheckoutService" as CS
rectangle "PaymentService" as PS
rectangle "MockWallet" as W
rectangle "EventDispatcher" as ED
rectangle "WebhookDeliveryJob" as WJ
actor "Покупатель" as C

Shop -right-> API : 1: POST /v1/checkout/sessions
API -down-> CS : 2: create()
C -right-> CS : 3: start_payment()
CS -right-> W : 4: create_payment_request()
C -down-> W : 5: approve(alice)
PS -up-> W : 6: get_payment_request(),\nget_transaction()
CS -down-> PS : 7: sync() при открытии страницы
PS -right-> ED : 8: publish(succeeded, completed)
ED -down-> WJ : 9: outbox (через БД)
WJ -left-> Shop : 10: POST /webhook (подписан)
@enduml
